1063
00:58:30.968 --> 00:58:32.660
[Sparkling sound effect]

1064
00:58:32.727 --> 00:58:34.727
[Exciting music]

1065
00:58:42.603 --> 00:58:44.197
Oh, can I do that?

1066
00:58:44.264 --> 00:58:46.796
to win me
How hard have you worked?

1067
