1083
01:00:43.320 --> 01:00:44.625
{\an8}This is my younger brother.

1084
01:00:44.692 --> 01:00:46.423
{\an8}(Juyeon) No, your boyfriend might be younger.

1085
01:00:46.490 --> 01:00:47.724
{\an8}Why is it your younger brother?

1086
01:00:47.791 --> 01:00:49.726
{\an8}(Sujeong) Why is it like that, it keeps confusing people?

1087
01:00:49.793 --> 01:00:52.930
{\an8}(Juyeon) Still, I struggle alone
Isn’t it a bit difficult? lonely and

1088
01:00:52.997 --> 01:00:54.131
{\an8}(Edited) But

1089
01:00:55.234 --> 01:00:57.935
{\an8}Are you interested in me?

